  "description": "A quick update on our positions",
  "body_html": "<p>Most positions are doing really well…surprisingly well considering the market downturn. This is kind of to be expected after such a parabolic January. The <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF</a> continues to crush the S&amp;P 500. I have to be honest…I am pretty proud of that stock basket build. 🥳 </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jXK1!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d39a647-389a-4eb3-a3ce-f06558099ecf_901x821.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jXK1!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d39a647-389a-4eb3-a3ce-f06558099ecf_901x821.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jXK1!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d39a647-389a-4eb3-a3ce-f06558099ecf_901x821.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jXK1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d39a647-389a-4eb3-a3ce-f06558099ecf_901x821.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jXK1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d39a647-389a-4eb3-a3ce-f06558099ecf_901x821.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jXK1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d39a647-389a-4eb3-a3ce-f06558099ecf_901x821.png\" width=\"901\" height=\"821\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8d39a647-389a-4eb3-a3ce-f06558099ecf_901x821.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:821,&quot;width&quot;:901,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:66628,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/186985394?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d39a647-389a-4eb3-a3ce-f06558099ecf_901x821.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jXK1!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d39a647-389a-4eb3-a3ce-f06558099ecf_901x821.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jXK1!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d39a647-389a-4eb3-a3ce-f06558099ecf_901x821.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jXK1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d39a647-389a-4eb3-a3ce-f06558099ecf_901x821.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jXK1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d39a647-389a-4eb3-a3ce-f06558099ecf_901x821.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">StockTok ETF is running upwards while most stocks continue to plummet</figcaption></figure></div><p>I am optimistic for tech stocks to, eventually, make a recovery. History may or may not repeat, but normally, if finance stocks run (as they are now), tech follows behind later on. </p><p>Regardless of our good news, the VIX is over 21. Will it hold? And for how long? No idea. But we do rules based investing here. <strong>When the VIX is over 21, I do not pick up any new positions or add to current ones.</strong> Period. Yes, some stocks will go up still, but it is certainly not the majority, as indicated by the S&amp;P 500 trending down. This is investing in less than optimal time. All the dip buyers for assets like PYPL, UNH, NVO…<strong>CRUSHED</strong>. Do not throw more money into the market when strategy is not working. Buy strength! Not weakness!</p><p><strong>Quick note: </strong>I will be out Friday, 2/6/2026. Am chaperoning a field trip. I intend to still get a market weekly wrap up video out, but it will be later in the day. </p><h4><strong>A few quick position updates for paid subscribers: </strong></h4><div class=\"paywall-jump\" data-component-name=\"PaywallToDOM\"></div><p>The only stock truly on my radar to potentially…potentially…get cut is Applied Digital Corporation, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$APLD&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>. </p><p>I am hesitant to do so though…</p><p>APLD was purchased due to a breakout on the monthly timeframe. So day to day volatility was/is expected. On the daily chart,<em><strong> we have not even made a lower low</strong></em>. I confess, the distance between current price and the local low ($23.42) is a bit of a distance.  I am bringing this up because some of you may need to make a decision:</p><ol><li><p>Hold it and incur more risk</p></li><li><p>Cut it</p></li><li><p>Trim the position to reduce portfolio risk</p></li></ol><p>I cannot guarantee it will go back up. But this chart still reminds me of Rigetti. We held Rigetti for about 2 months, some of that relatively painful…before it became one of our best performing assets. Again, I cannot guarantee it will be our next Rigetti. </p><p><strong>I am choosing to continue holding</strong>. We had an initial position in this, so it wont break the portfolio by any means…but I know some of you go in heavier, so I want to simply put the warning, and my game plan out there. <strong>Do what is best for you. </strong></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QI-o!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5e1fa63d-1793-48c5-af95-fdec1376f174_1155x823.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QI-o!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5e1fa63d-1793-48c5-af95-fdec1376f174_1155x823.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QI-o!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5e1fa63d-1793-48c5-af95-fdec1376f174_1155x823.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QI-o!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5e1fa63d-1793-48c5-af95-fdec1376f174_1155x823.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QI-o!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5e1fa63d-1793-48c5-af95-fdec1376f174_1155x823.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QI-o!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5e1fa63d-1793-48c5-af95-fdec1376f174_1155x823.png\" width=\"1155\" height=\"823\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5e1fa63d-1793-48c5-af95-fdec1376f174_1155x823.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:823,&quot;width&quot;:1155,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:101430,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&