Fimages%2F3d427038-7ef6-4e2e-b631-f11f3dffbbd0_1171x557.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XCqs!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3d427038-7ef6-4e2e-b631-f11f3dffbbd0_1171x557.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">No lower low. Could it go lower? Absolutely. But it has not yet, and thus I have no justifiable reason to cut it right now.</figcaption></figure></div><p>Quantum Scape is the other black eye. I have made my position on solid state batteries clear. I am not selling. I am actually happy to see copper showing weakness…what I speculate to be a future catalyst for solid state batteries. If you do not hold the same beliefs as me on solid state batteries, then by all means…CUT IT. You will not hurt my feelings. This was another chart based on the monthly…and as painful as <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$QS&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> has been, it is still in an uptrend. you were warned this one bounces around A LOT. Again, do what is best for you. </p><p>The rest of the positions are doing fine. No need to toot horns. But I figured some of you were nervous about those positions: justifiably so. </p><p>Make a decision best for you. We do have some trades that go in the gutter, just part of the game. Its more important we double down on our winners, cut losers, and have a high batting average over the year. If you have questions, as always, I am available in the main chat during market hours. </p><p>Have a great day and thanks for stopping by! </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p> </p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
  "truncated_body_text": "Most positions are doing really well…surprisingly well considering the market downturn. This is kind of to be expected after such a parabolic January. The StockTok ETF continues to crush the S&P 500. I have to be honest…I am pretty proud of that stock basket build. 🥳",
